{"id": "16-2567-2-2", "zh": "以 ṭha 结尾的词根", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2568-2-5", "zh": "Saṭha：用于修整与行走之义。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-2568-6-9", "zh": "Saṭheti、saṭhayati。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "16-2569-2-4", "zh": "Suṭha：用于懒惰之义。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2569-5-8", "zh": "Soṭheti、soṭhayati。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "16-2570-2-4", "zh": "Suṭhi：用于干燥之义。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2570-5-8", "zh": "Suṇṭheti、suṇṭhayati。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "16-2571-2-4", "zh": "Saṭha：用于夸耀之义。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-2571-5-8", "zh": "Saṭheti、saṭhayati。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "16-2572-2-4", "zh": "Saṭha：用于说话不正当之义。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2572-5-6", "zh": "Saṭheti。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "16-2572-7-10", "zh": "Saṭhayati、saṭho。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "16-2573-2-6", "zh": "这里的 **saṭho**，是指狡诈的人。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2573-7-14", "zh": "因为说话不正当，所以叫作 saṭho，意思是不如实地说话。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2574-2-4", "zh": "Saṭha：用于欺诈之义。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2574-5-7", "zh": "它的变化形式与上面相同。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2575-2-12", "zh": "“别人的过失容易看见，自己的过失却难以看见……乃至……", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2576-2-11", "zh": "却把自己的过失遮掩起来，就像狡猾的捕鸟人把自己藏起来一样。”", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "16-2577-2-11", "zh": "这里，捕鸟人被称为 “kitavā”。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2577-12-22", "zh": "他的这种手段就叫 ketava，意思是这个词根用于这种欺诈之义。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-2578-2-4", "zh": "Kaṭhi：用于忧愁之义。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2578-5-8", "zh": "Kaṇṭheti、kaṇṭhayati。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "16-2579-2-4", "zh": "以上是以 ṭha 结尾的词根的变化形式。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-2580-2-2", "zh": "以 ḍa 结尾的词根", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2581-2-4", "zh": "Paṭi：用于嘲笑之义。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2581-5-8", "zh": "Paṇḍeti、paṇḍayati。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "16-2581-9-12", "zh": "Uppaṇḍeti、uppaṇḍayati。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "16-2581-13-17", "zh": "人们嘲笑那位比丘尼。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-2582-2-4", "zh": "Laḍi：用于抛起之义。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2582-5-8", "zh": "Laṇḍeti、laṇḍayati。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "16-2583-2-5", "zh": "Khaḍi、kaḍi：用于切断之义。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2583-6-9", "zh": "Khaṇḍeti、khaṇḍayati。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "16-2583-10-13", "zh": "Kaṇḍeti、kaṇḍayati。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "16-2583-14-17", "zh": "Khaṇḍo、kaṇḍo。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "16-2584-2-5", "zh": "Piḍi：用于聚合之义。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2584-6-9", "zh": "Piṇḍeti、piṇḍayati。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "16-2584-10-11", "zh": "Piṇḍo。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "16-2585-2-22", "zh": "这里的 **piṇḍo**，既指称为聚集的团块，也指在“衣服、团食、欢乐、游戏”这句话里所说的、称为食物的团食，两者都叫 piṇḍo。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-2586-2-4", "zh": "Kuḍi：用于穿刺之义。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-2586-5-8", "zh": "Kuṇḍeti、kuṇḍayati。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "16-2586-9-10", "zh": "Kuṇḍalaṃ。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "16-2587-2-6", "zh": "Maḍi：用于装饰与欢笑之义。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2587-7-10", "zh": "Maṇḍeti、maṇḍayati。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "16-2587-11-16", "zh": "Maṇḍo、maṇḍanaṃ、maṇḍito。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "16-2588-2-4", "zh": "Bhaḍi：用于美好之义。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2588-5-7", "zh": "美好，就是美好的状态。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-2588-8-11", "zh": "Bhaṇḍeti、bhaṇḍayati。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "16-2588-12-13", "zh": "Bhaṇḍo。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "16-2589-2-10", "zh": "这里的 **bhaṇḍo**，是指财物，或者装饰品。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2589-11-15", "zh": "例如“拿取财物”，", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2589-16-24", "zh": "以及“用装饰品打扮好”等句子里的用法。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2590-2-4", "zh": "Daṇḍa：用于施加杖罚之义。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2590-5-8", "zh": "Daṇḍeti、daṇḍayati。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "16-2590-9-10", "zh": "Daṇḍo。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "16-2591-2-4", "zh": "Chaḍḍa：用于舍弃之义。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-2591-5-8", "zh": "Chaḍḍeti、chaḍḍayati。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "16-2591-9-10", "zh": "Chaḍḍanako。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "16-2591-11-14", "zh": "Chaḍḍiyati、chaḍḍito。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "16-2591-15-22", "zh": "Chaḍḍituṃ、chaḍḍayituṃ、chaḍḍetvā、chaḍḍayitvā。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "16-2592-2-3", "zh": "以上是以 ḍa 结尾的词根的变化形式。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-2593-2-2", "zh": "以 ḍha 结尾的词根", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2594-2-4", "zh": "Vaḍḍha：用于盛放（食物）之义。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-2594-5-10", "zh": "在铜钵里盛上乳粥：vaḍḍheti、vaḍḍhayati。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2594-11-14", "zh": "把饭盛好后给了出去。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2595-2-5", "zh": "以上是以 ḍha 结尾的词根的变化形式。", "confidence": 90}
